[{:db/id 17592186407606 :question/problem "Consider the following predicates.\n\n$\\,$ $A(x):$ $x\\in Z.$ $\\,$ $B(x):$ $-x\\in Z.$\n\nWhich of the following is equivalent to the biconditional predicate $A(x)⇔B(x)?$\n\nI. If $x\\in Z$ then $-x\\in Z$, and if $-x\\in Z$ then $x\\in Z.$\n\nII. $x\\in Z$ is equivalent to $-x\\in Z.$\n\nIII. $x\\in Z$ if and only if $-x\\in Z.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186381679 :question/problem "Consider the following predicates.\n\n$\\,$ $A(x):$ $3\\,|\\,x.$ $\\,$ $B(x):$ $3\\,|\\,(x+15).$\n\nWhich of the following is equivalent to the biconditional predicate $A(x)⇔B(x)?$\n\nI. $3\\,|\\,x$ if and only if $5\\,|x.$\n\nII. If $3\\,|\\,x$ then $3\\,|\\,(x+15),$ or if $3\\,|\\,(x+15)$ then $3\\,|\\,x.$\n\nIII. If $3\\,|\\,x$ then $3\\,|\\,(x+15),$ and if $3\\,|\\,(x+15)$ then $3\\,|\\,x.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186198260 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-eaeaaf30-4952-5f5c-8d39-72353700d469"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-eaeaaf30-4952-5f5c-8d39-72353700d469" :question/id #uuid "eaeaaf30-4952-5f5c-8d39-72353700d469" :question/math-academy-id "q-183375" :question/problem "For the universal set $U,$ given by\n\n$$\nU=\\{2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9\\},\n$$\n\nfind the truth set of $P(x)⇔Q(x)$ for the following predicates: \n\n- $P(x):$ $x$ is prime.\n\n- $Q(x):$ $3\\,|\\,x.$" :question/worked-solution "Since we have that\n\n$$\nP(x)⇔Q(x)≡(P(x)∧Q(x))∨(¬P(x)∧¬Q(x)),\n$$\n\nthe corresponding truth set can be found as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}_{P⇔Q}=({T}_{P}\\cap {T}_{Q})\\cup ({\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}\\cap {\\overset{―}{T}}_{Q})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that:\n\n- The truth set of $P(x)$ is \n\n$$\n{T}_{P}=\\{2,3,5,7\\}\n$$\n\nand its complement is\n\n$$\n{\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}=\\{4,6,8,9\\}.\n$$\n\n- The truth set of $Q(x)$ is \n\n$$\n{T}_{Q}=\\{3,6,9\\}\n$$\n\n \nand its complement is\n\n$$\n{\\overset{―}{T}}_{Q}=\\{2,4,5,7,8\\}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}_{P}\\cap {T}_{Q} & =\\{2,3,5,7\\}\\cap \\{3,6,9\\} \\\\  & =\\{3\\} \\\\ {\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}\\cap {\\overset{―}{T}}_{Q} & =\\{4,6,8,9\\}\\cap \\{2,4,5,7,8\\} \\\\  & =\\{4,8\\} \\\\ {T}_{P⇔Q} & =({T}_{P}\\cap {T}_{Q})\\cup ({\\overset{―}{T}}_{P}\\cap {\\overset{―}{T}}_{Q}) \\\\  & =\\{3\\}\\cup \\{4,8\\} \\\\  & =\\{3,4,8\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-37dbab6b-7900-50e7-95bc-74222427c1bc"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-37dbab6b-7900-50e7-95bc-74222427c1bc" :answer-field/id #uuid "37dbab6b-7900-50e7-95bc-74222427c1bc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-45fbefc3-395f-553e-8152-7832975cb2b4" :answer-field/choices ["answer-92df1202-bc4c-5672-b477-6087c1ffb4aa" "answer-45fbefc3-395f-553e-8152-7832975cb2b4" "answer-85d15c0a-e480-56cb-87dd-9d1c782d2cbf" "answer-b2060cd9-9bdc-52df-a275-e3dc56e88953" "answer-5745fcfd-fe55-53c5-a054-56fdf9cfc204"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-92df1202-bc4c-5672-b477-6087c1ffb4aa" :answer/id #uuid "92df1202-bc4c-5672-b477-6087c1ffb4aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{2,4,5,7,8\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-45fbefc3-395f-553e-8152-7832975cb2b4" :answer/id #uuid "45fbefc3-395f-553e-8152-7832975cb2b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{3,4,8\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-85d15c0a-e480-56cb-87dd-9d1c782d2cbf" :answer/id #uuid "85d15c0a-e480-56cb-87dd-9d1c782d2cbf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{3,6,9\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b2060cd9-9bdc-52df-a275-e3dc56e88953" :answer/id #uuid "b2060cd9-9bdc-52df-a275-e3dc56e88953" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{4,6,8,9\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5745fcfd-fe55-53c5-a054-56fdf9cfc204" :answer/id #uuid "5745fcfd-fe55-53c5-a054-56fdf9cfc204" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{4,8\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-1275d73e-e355-535a-8360-6bc7c66fdc10" :activity/id #uuid "1275d73e-e355-535a-8360-6bc7c66fdc10" :activity/title "Conditional Statements With Predicates" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186048574 :activity/course 17592186046658 :activity/steps ["step-ecd1d17c-94e6-540b-ace4-f35a9f9b3d94" "step-427c4899-8f2f-5df5-bfb1-7ef58c544fcd" "step-cbf2292b-9b8c-565b-b4c1-35f38e115eef" "step-bad485c1-18f8-57ef-850a-fe161c531db2" "step-13bbe632-d3a1-5ea4-917d-ac97d5a9c56e"] :activity/first-step "step-ecd1d17c-94e6-540b-ace4-f35a9f9b3d94" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-ecd1d17c-94e6-540b-ace4-f35a9f9b3d94" :step/id #uuid "ecd1d17c-94e6-540b-ace4-f35a9f9b3d94" :step/content 17592186381665 :step/next "step-427c4899-8f2f-5df5-bfb1-7ef58c544fcd" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-427c4899-8f2f-5df5-bfb1-7ef58c544fcd" :step/id #uuid "427c4899-8f2f-5df5-bfb1-7ef58c544fcd" :step/content 17592186407606 :step/next "step-cbf2292b-9b8c-565b-b4c1-35f38e115eef" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-cbf2292b-9b8c-565b-b4c1-35f38e115eef" :step/id #uuid "cbf2292b-9b8c-565b-b4c1-35f38e115eef" :step/content 17592186381679 :step/next "step-bad485c1-18f8-57ef-850a-fe161c531db2" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-bad485c1-18f8-57ef-850a-fe161c531db2" :step/id #uuid "bad485c1-18f8-57ef-850a-fe161c531db2" :step/content "question-eaeaaf30-4952-5f5c-8d39-72353700d469" :step/next "step-13bbe632-d3a1-5ea4-917d-ac97d5a9c56e" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-13bbe632-d3a1-5ea4-917d-ac97d5a9c56e" :step/id #uuid "13bbe632-d3a1-5ea4-917d-ac97d5a9c56e" :step/content 17592186381686 :db/ensure [:step/validate]}]
